# Changes to these paths need an approving review from a code owner who is not the PR's author.
# The `main` ruleset enforces it and dismisses the approval when a later push changes the diff.
# `.github/workflows/AGENTS.md` ("Code owners") explains the scopes.

# Dependencies, at any depth
pyproject.toml            @pydantic/pydantic-ai-admin @pydantic/pydantic-ai-maintain
uv.lock                   @pydantic/pydantic-ai-admin @pydantic/pydantic-ai-maintain

# CI config
/.github/workflows/       @pydantic/pydantic-ai-admin @pydantic/pydantic-ai-maintain
/.github/actions/         @pydantic/pydantic-ai-admin @pydantic/pydantic-ai-maintain
/.github/scripts/         @pydantic/pydantic-ai-admin @pydantic/pydantic-ai-maintain
/.pre-commit-config.yaml  @pydantic/pydantic-ai-admin @pydantic/pydantic-ai-maintain
/Makefile                 @pydantic/pydantic-ai-admin @pydantic/pydantic-ai-maintain

# This file. Unowned, a PR could drop an owner and the next PR change that path unreviewed.
/.github/CODEOWNERS       @pydantic/pydantic-ai-admin @pydantic/pydantic-ai-maintain
